              "text": "کارتخوان (kârtkhân) — \"a card machine, a card reader\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کارتخوان (kârtkhân) نانوایی خراب بود. Kârtkhân-e nânvâyi kharâb bud. The bakery's card machine was out of order."
            },
