              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بقال محله به ما نسیه میدهد. Baqqâl-e mahalle be mâ nesye midahad. The local grocer lets us buy on credit."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nesye kharidan — to buy on credit. The opposite is naqd 'cash'."
